    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stepping outside of it entirely\"... that sounds almost peaceful, i guess. but it also sounds so permanent. like you're saying there's no point in staying in the race if I've already lost. is that what you mean? that it's better to just let go of everything instead of fighting this every single day?",
